# Sneak on a sorcery (Donatello's Technique, K:Sneak:U): the Sneak spell has
# instant speed (CardFactoryUtil.java:3464, setInstantSpeed(true)) and is
# castable only in the declare blockers step (SpellAbilityRestriction.java:
# 312-316). Returning the unblocked Silvercoat Lion pays the Return part; the
# Lion leaves combat, so no combat damage is dealt. Draw two cards.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
tapformana human 5 U
queue returnchoice 1
castspell human 3
resolvestack
advance
advance
combatdamage
